  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"Tilsim Altilisi\" kart\u0131n\u0131 se\xE7tin.\n\nMaddiyat
    odakl\u0131 d\xF6nemlerden ge\xE7mi\u015Fsin. Bir \u015Feyler al\u0131nm\u0131\u015F,
    bir \u015Feyler b\xF6l\xFC\u015F\xFClm\xFC\u015F, bir \u015Feyler da\u011F\u0131t\u0131lm\u0131\u015F
    ve genellikle veren taraf sen olmu\u015Fsun. Senden eksildi\u011Fi i\xE7in zararl\u0131
    \xE7\u0131kan da sen miydin? Hay\u0131r. Senin hissene \"hay\u0131rl\u0131 olan\"
    d\xFC\u015Fm\xFC\u015F. Belki bor\xE7lar\u0131n\u0131 \xF6dedin, belki infak
    ettin ve ba\u011F\u0131\u015F yapt\u0131n. Hem hay\u0131r i\u015Flemi\u015F ve
    sevap kazanm\u0131\u015F, hem  de takdir toplam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n {{isim}}.
    Netice itibariyle as\u0131l sen kazanm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. B\xF6ld\xFCklerinle
    \xE7o\u011Falm\u0131\u015F, maddi ve manevi pek \xE7ok s\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131ndan
    kurtulmu\u015Fsun. Verdiklerin sana daha fazla bolluk getirmi\u015F. Sonu\xE7
    olarak, ihtiyac\u0131n olandan fazlas\u0131n\u0131 elde etmi\u015Fsin."
